        "en": "Customers appreciate the large shop layout, convenient parking within Forge Retail Park, and wide availability of pet food, reptile accessories, and supplies. While a couple of reviewers complained about the cleanliness of fish tanks or sticks in small animal hay, most describe a well-stocked and clean store."
