        "en": "Shoppers highlight the welcoming environment for visiting pets, noting that staff pay close attention to animal body language and offer reassurance to nervous dogs. Reviewers also appreciate the on-site veterinary surgeon who handled an anxious cat gently during routine vaccinations."
      }
